meta {
  name: X5 — API suite: records (createRecord, getRecord)
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  TICK-357. Create a record of a new entity type and read it back: 201 with `ETag` and `Location`, a retry with the same Idempotency-Key returning the same record, 422 `record_invalid` for a missing field and for a reference that does not exist (no constraint text), and the one 404 for a missing record, another tenant's record and an unknown entity type. 429, 500 and 501 are in the coverage page. Self-contained; every run uses a new type key. Needs `tools/seed.sh`.
}
